athML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. Since the graph of the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> passes through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 1\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> must be a factor of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is a factor if the graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> passed through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 1 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is a factor if the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> passed through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 4 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is a factor if the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> passed through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/M