p;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 1\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> must be a factor of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is a factor if the graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> passed through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 1 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is a factor if the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> passed through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 4 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is a factor if the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> passed through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 5 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>","externalid":"faf32f9b-26f8-4ad5-8215-b6f52b1118f5","correct_answer":["C"]},"createDate":1776362727994,"updateDate":1776362727994}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1776362727994, 1776362727994),
    ($SATQ$4d7064a6$SATQ$, $SATQ$65743096-f9d1-4ab0-9a10-3acd3ea46114$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$b69140f5-2d4a-425f-8045-9cebbbaea29e$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear functions$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 6, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: center;"><math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis x minus 10 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 13 right parenthesis"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>
