    ($SATQ$4eaf0a3a$SATQ$, $SATQ$34c2743d-443b-43f9-ad72-c43601418315$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$8299a45f-a899-4dfa-a91a-4365a805e126$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.A.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Equivalent expressions$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p>Which expression is equivalent to <math alttext="RootIndex 7 StartRoot x Superscript 9 Baseline y Superscript 9 Baseline EndRoot"><mroot>
