</math>. Therefore, each term in the expression, <math alttext="StartFraction 8 x left parenthesis x minus 7 right parenthesis minus 3 left parenthesis x minus 7 right parenthesis Over 2 left parenthesis x minus 7 right parenthesis EndFraction"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>, can be divided by <math alttext="left parenthesis x minus 7 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, which gives&nbsp;<math alttext="StartFraction 8 x minus 3 Over 2 EndFraction"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>
